        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "79121f57-d710-3fc5-a9d1-c6fd5692b086",
                "word": "baiseur",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "2cca1f5e-c7c4-4d6f-a072-360813b4077e",
                        "entry_id": "79121f57-d710-3fc5-a9d1-c6fd5692b086",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "baiseurs"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "6180665a-59a4-4f82-843c-2b9ad8ba99eb",
                        "entry_id": "79121f57-d710-3fc5-a9d1-c6fd5692b086",
                        "tags": [
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "baiseuse"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b96184dd-517e-3426-8b87-45d97cfbf06e",
                        "entry_id": "79121f57-d710-3fc5-a9d1-c6fd5692b086",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Celui qui baise, embrasse."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "dated"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "81e477aa-b0ee-3c2e-b4ca-f353e72d7498",
                        "entry_id": "79121f57-d710-3fc5-a9d1-c6fd5692b086",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui se plaît à baiser, à faire l’amour."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "vulgar"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "34026ea8-d150-499b-9e7b-1418bdb9bd88",
                                "sense_id": "81e477aa-b0ee-3c2e-b4ca-f353e72d7498",
                                "text": "Je ne suis rien qu’un ivrogne,\nQuoiqu’on m’estime baiseur…"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bc001b8c-3749-4d04-98d9-80b1bb80a718",
                                "sense_id": "81e477aa-b0ee-3c2e-b4ca-f353e72d7498",
                                "text": "Je pense aussi à Blanche de Namur, qui s’en fut en Norvège, suivie de ses dames d’honneur, épouser le Folkengar Magnus, surnommé le Baiseur, et vécut fort librement dans une cour fort libre, insultée ainsi que son voluptueux jeune époux par l’austère sainte Brigitte."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "006208fe-1111-4af7-b5e5-4dfdcdbbe5e9",
                                "sense_id": "81e477aa-b0ee-3c2e-b4ca-f353e72d7498",
                                "text": "Hélas, cette conception du lyrique et de l’épique est si peu familière aux Français que j’ai été obligé de consentir que, dans la traduction française, le coureur lyrique devienne le baiseur romantique, et le coureur épique le baiseur libertin."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a249fcf0-46a2-487a-8e2f-e84affba33a6",
                                "sense_id": "81e477aa-b0ee-3c2e-b4ca-f353e72d7498",
                                "text": "T’imagines les bragging rights quand tu remportes la médaille d’or pour le meilleur baiseur au monde ? […] ? Il y aurait de la groupie à l’aéroport en revenant!"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b188e150-397a-45f9-af5b-04bfae21a809",
                        "source_entry_id": "79121f57-d710-3fc5-a9d1-c6fd5692b086",
                        "target_lang_word": "shagger",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "shagger",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7c492c0e-d39b-30ba-9a35-9116cdb4d86a",
                                        "entry_id": "f64d46ba-cbf4-3ad1-9a78-91b6b9a89ff7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who shags.",
                                            "One who has sexual intercourse."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a0053fbc-d8b7-407a-be90-80d27a509576",
                                                "sense_id": "7c492c0e-d39b-30ba-9a35-9116cdb4d86a",
                                                "text": "1997, The Bulletin, Issues 6061-6069, page 74,\n[…] deracinated German, ace journalist and communist spy, compulsive cocktail drinker and serial shagger: the agent of penetration par excellence is engaging in sexual congress with a secretary from the German embassy in the Japanese capital."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a17199db-c61b-4422-9304-6cce29dbd5a8",
                                                "sense_id": "7c492c0e-d39b-30ba-9a35-9116cdb4d86a",
                                                "text": "‘What do you want to be remembered for, being the best shaggers and drinkers or the best rugby players?’"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6972fa91-7f79-4881-9663-e40901f07cae",
                                                "sense_id": "7c492c0e-d39b-30ba-9a35-9116cdb4d86a",
                                                "text": "There would be card schools, too, and when we overnighted the shaggers among the lads would be sniffing after everything in a skirt."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "febef129-60fe-3739-8ac8-f50483b12d1a",
                                        "entry_id": "f64d46ba-cbf4-3ad1-9a78-91b6b9a89ff7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who shags.",
                                            "One who catches and returns a ball, usually out of play; one who fetches played balls; one who fetches shot game."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5c8c6bd9-2e75-4962-b2de-e2a2f33301d7",
                                                "sense_id": "febef129-60fe-3739-8ac8-f50483b12d1a",
                                                "text": "The shagger is placed in this position to avoid the danger of his being hit by a batted ball."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0b309c90-e251-495d-8de7-bdd70ff29b45",
                                                "sense_id": "febef129-60fe-3739-8ac8-f50483b12d1a",
                                                "text": "As we arrived at the grainfield a covey of little Mexican boys swarmed in from all directions, waving and yelling and climbing on the bumpers, vying for jobs as bird shaggers. Birds were darting low over the vehicles and somebody got excited and started shooting right there, bringing the kids racing for the fallen birds, because whoever got one had a job for sure."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "99248dcc-51d5-4034-8c83-67174cd5f6e9",
                                                "sense_id": "febef129-60fe-3739-8ac8-f50483b12d1a",
                                                "text": "As soon as the outfielder releases the throw to the shagger, a second ball is fungoed and the fielder must react quickly,[…]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7406fb3c-861e-4a88-802a-389892b1b860",
                                                "sense_id": "febef129-60fe-3739-8ac8-f50483b12d1a",
                                                "text": "He always had a shagger, a caddy who put the shag bag right in front of his feet."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "39f43477-8039-34c4-9e07-19af079a56a2",
                                        "entry_id": "f64d46ba-cbf4-3ad1-9a78-91b6b9a89ff7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who dances the shag; a jazz dancer."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "825e7089-ee3b-4e41-aca8-511b2152f6b7",
                                                "sense_id": "39f43477-8039-34c4-9e07-19af079a56a2",
                                                "text": "2012, Renee Wright, Myrtle Beach & South Carolina′s Grand Strand, Explorer′s Guides, unnumbered page,\nThe first gathering proved so successful that SOS has expanded to a year-round schedule of events, including annual ten-day Spring Safaris and Fall Migrations, attracting up to 10,000 shaggers at a time, plus weekend gatherings in winter and summer."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e41353ff-1e4a-4c57-b123-5141448f1964",
                        "source_entry_id": "79121f57-d710-3fc5-a9d1-c6fd5692b086",
                        "target_lang_word": "fucker",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "fucker",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5591b197-f5ac-308a-b2fc-56a9f11ffde8",
                                        "entry_id": "19a01107-602e-3dec-a3e5-c7075c61c779",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An undesirable person."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "offensive",
                                            "vulgar"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dddb2d5b-a2a0-43d1-b14b-eb7b39cf6e33",
                                                "sense_id": "5591b197-f5ac-308a-b2fc-56a9f11ffde8",
                                                "text": "You fucker, you wrecked my car!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "090a6c0d-fce8-4ffc-8237-46bf6e5dc44d",
                                                "sense_id": "5591b197-f5ac-308a-b2fc-56a9f11ffde8",
                                                "text": "There are many fuckers in the warehouses."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "20c8e2de-6c79-4b5f-84f8-632d2114f50c",
                                                "sense_id": "5591b197-f5ac-308a-b2fc-56a9f11ffde8",
                                                "text": "There are lots of fuckers out here."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b3c86792-a267-4458-8f09-c5e294f52c0f",
                                                "sense_id": "5591b197-f5ac-308a-b2fc-56a9f11ffde8",
                                                "text": "That fucker stabbed me with a knife!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "04256154-4ab8-49f6-a764-d32713cbaeb4",
                                                "sense_id": "5591b197-f5ac-308a-b2fc-56a9f11ffde8",
                                                "text": "You didn't tell me that this was for children. I hate children. I'd raise money to have the little fuckers put down. I want me money back!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d5a181d5-3d1d-3560-80c9-d8727a726941",
                                        "entry_id": "19a01107-602e-3dec-a3e5-c7075c61c779",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "vulgar"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b270781f-9531-4731-a0cf-dd3b3de02fbb",
                                                "sense_id": "d5a181d5-3d1d-3560-80c9-d8727a726941",
                                                "text": "Never stood a chance. The poor fucker was cooked."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f12570df-1922-4516-aa34-23aa329280e1",
                                                "sense_id": "d5a181d5-3d1d-3560-80c9-d8727a726941",
                                                "text": "It’s easy to get reflective after a few brunchtime cocktails. “Was I one of these little fuckers?” Savannah Engel wondered aloud to me one Sunday after Bloody Marys at Cafe Cluny."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ec178014-bf25-327a-b7d2-ac1c322b1d28",
                                        "entry_id": "19a01107-602e-3dec-a3e5-c7075c61c779",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The object of some effort."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "vulgar"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d4ef9e2a-f004-47d5-9c05-2beac4435dfb",
                                                "sense_id": "ec178014-bf25-327a-b7d2-ac1c322b1d28",
                                                "text": "Let’s see if we can fix this fucker."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9d206db9-3a39-4ac0-be9e-6bd09ead4c95",
                                                "sense_id": "ec178014-bf25-327a-b7d2-ac1c322b1d28",
                                                "text": "Now if I can put that fucker in there installed."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "73ed7aea-6ed7-44ca-86a4-e90ed87b7b58",
                                                "sense_id": "ec178014-bf25-327a-b7d2-ac1c322b1d28",
                                                "text": "I wanted to look up velleity and quotidian and memorize the fuckers for all time, spell them, learn them, pronounce them syllable by syllable—vocalize, phonate, utter the sounds, say the words for all they're worth."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "459794f5-75e5-3b49-8ca8-8727fb6f978f",
                                        "entry_id": "19a01107-602e-3dec-a3e5-c7075c61c779",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who fucks."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "rare",
                                            "vulgar"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1d41753c-1b9d-4fa1-b444-d8c5fc6cb90b",
                                                "sense_id": "459794f5-75e5-3b49-8ca8-8727fb6f978f",
                                                "text": "She was a good fucker, but to tell the truth, I had had enough for the night."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "27abe820-3b19-415f-ae93-6afb96b44339",
                                                "sense_id": "459794f5-75e5-3b49-8ca8-8727fb6f978f",
                                                "text": "A system in which men are conditioned to be the pursuer, the agressor ^([sic]), the possessor, the fucker."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "414558a5-8695-4d03-b3f0-ee3fbd876089",
                        "source_entry_id": "79121f57-d710-3fc5-a9d1-c6fd5692b086",
                        "target_lang_word": "follador",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5135d977-ac61-4817-9695-e947ab3dde2e",
                        "source_entry_id": "79121f57-d710-3fc5-a9d1-c6fd5692b086",
                        "target_lang_word": "ёбарь",
                        "target_lang_code": "ru",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ёбарь",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "46ebbb78-b7c2-3cc6-8eb7-e1e132d777f7",
                                        "entry_id": "72602e96-0d84-30da-820c-07dee333c5a2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "обсц. знаток, искусник в половом акте"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ee007c5f-0af0-4cb5-9b73-885898667f9f",
                                                "sense_id": "46ebbb78-b7c2-3cc6-8eb7-e1e132d777f7",
                                                "text": "Он уважал в себе ёбаря и был теоретиком этого дела — и практиком!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fab90451-3037-497c-8925-0d39262102d0",
                                                "sense_id": "46ebbb78-b7c2-3cc6-8eb7-e1e132d777f7",
                                                "text": "— Я счастлива! Он ёбарь каких я не встречала! Он меня носит на руках подмываться!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9e96e007-55fe-42db-b044-4f9272666a70",
                                                "sense_id": "46ebbb78-b7c2-3cc6-8eb7-e1e132d777f7",
                                                "text": "— Слушай, — она вдруг грустно и доверчиво оживилась, — а ты всё такой же потрясающий ёбарь?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aad5ae90-e266-3e77-80ce-211e5c056af5",
                                        "entry_id": "72602e96-0d84-30da-820c-07dee333c5a2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "обсц., сленг любовник; сексуальный партнёр; бойфренд"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "158f6dcf-0dc7-4d75-aed8-269d6186e41d",
                                                "sense_id": "aad5ae90-e266-3e77-80ce-211e5c056af5",
                                                "text": "Приходит заяц к слону. — Слониха дома? — Нет, а что передать? — Передай, что ёбарь заходил."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "56fb3f8c-b974-4c79-8a14-92f4af1bcd34",
                                                "sense_id": "aad5ae90-e266-3e77-80ce-211e5c056af5",
                                                "text": "Петухи поют, — // Проснулись! // Ебаря идут, — // Согнулись!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0e580637-312b-4201-9a5b-641ad8c02dac",
                                                "sense_id": "aad5ae90-e266-3e77-80ce-211e5c056af5",
                                                "text": "— Никогда и никто не найдёт мне издателя. Все находят для меня только ебаре́й. И половина этих ебаре́й на самом деле импотенты, это они комплексы так избывают, психоанализом занимаются сами с собой, пренатальные матрицы изживают, в задницу им хуй!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "443c1c4f-19d9-43e9-904a-6826198a6ad4",
                                                "sense_id": "aad5ae90-e266-3e77-80ce-211e5c056af5",
                                                "text": "Карпекина — она сидит за одной партой с Клоком — кривит губы. — Вообще у неё счас ёбарь есть. Какой-то начальник с химзавода. ❬…❭ Иван, наверное, её мужик или ёбарь, и какой он — здоровый или нет, — я не знаю и на всякий случай съебываюсь через калитку."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "015e6984-f748-47f4-b536-4589012ed1a6",
                                                "sense_id": "aad5ae90-e266-3e77-80ce-211e5c056af5",
                                                "text": "— А ёбарю этому мы с Витькой всё равно башку оторвём."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "word_linkages": [
